  "title": "Freightos Files Annual Report on Form 20-F for the Year Ended December 31, 2025",
  "summary": "Barcelona, Spain – Freightos Limited (NASDAQ: CRGO) the leading vendor-neutral global freight pricing, booking and procurement platform, announced today that it has filed its annual report on Form 20-F for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2025, with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”). The annual report, which contains Freightos’ audited financial statements, […]",
